          "content": "经过分析，当前函数`queryAllFinancingApply`可以拆分为几个更小的函数，每个函数负责一个明确的职责。以下是拆分后的代码：\n\n```java\n    /**\n     * 根据未完结单据查询并刷新融资结果\n     */\n    private void queryAllFinancingApply() {\n        HashMap<String, String> cmbStatusMapping = initCmbStatusMapping();\n        List<String> pendingStatus = Arrays.asList(SupplierFinancingApplyStatus.SEND_BANK.name());\n        List<PmcFinanceSupplierApply> financeSupplierApplyList =\n                pmcFinanceSupplierApplyMapper.getPendingFinanceApplyByStatus(pendingStatus);\n\n        log.info(\"待查询融资单据数量：{}\", financeSupplierApplyList.size());\n        processFinanceApplies(financeSupplierApplyList, cmbStatusMapping);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 初始化CMB状态映射表\n     * @return 包含CMB状态到PMC状态映射的HashMap\n     */\n    private HashMap<String, String> initCmbStatusMapping() {\n        HashMap<String, String> cmbStatusMapping = new HashMap<>();\n        cmbStatusMapping.put(\"00\", SupplierFinancingApplyStatus.BANK_PROCESSING.name());\n        cmbStatusMapping.put(\"01\", SupplierFinancingApplyStatus.REJECTED.name());\n        cmbStatusMapping.put(\"04\", SupplierFinancingApplyStatus.PENDING_DISBURSEMEN.name());\n        cmbStatusMapping.put(\"08\", SupplierFinancingApplyStatus.DISBURSED.name());\n        cmbStatusMapping.put(\"09\", SupplierFinancingApplyStatus.REJECT.name());\n        cmbStatusMapping.put(\"20\", SupplierFinancingApplyStatus.SETTLED.name());\n        return cmbStatusMapping;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 处理融资申请列表\n     * @param financeSupplierApplyList 待处理的融资申请列表\n     * @param cmbStatusMapping CMB状态映射表\n     */\n    private void processFinanceApplies(List<PmcFinanceSupplierApply> financeSupplierApplyList, \n                                     HashMap<String, String> cmbStatusMapping) {\n        financeSupplierApplyList.forEach(apply -> {\n            processSingleApply(apply, cmbStatusMapping);\n        });\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 处理单个融资申请\n     * @param apply 融资申请对象\n     * @param cmbStatusMapping CMB状态映射表\n     */\n    private void processSingleApply(PmcFinanceSupplierApply apply, \n                                  HashMap<String, String> cmbStatusMapping) {\n        PmcFinanceBankBaseQO query = new PmcFinanceBankBaseQO();\n        query.setFinanceNumber(apply.getBankApplyNumber());\n        ResponseMessage responseMessage = this.financingApplyDetails(query);\n        \n        if (ResponseMessage.OK.equals(responseMessage.getStatus())) {\n            handleSuccessfulResponse(apply, cmbStatusMapping, responseMessage);\n        } else {\n            log.info(\"单据：{},查询银行状态异常，返回异常\", apply.getApplyNumber());\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 处理成功的银行响应\n     * @param apply 融资申请对象\n     * @param cmbStatusMapping CMB状态映射表\n     * @param responseMessage 银行响应消息\n     */\n    private void handleSuccessfulResponse(PmcFinanceSupplierApply apply,\n                                        HashMap<String, String> cmbStatusMapping,\n                                        ResponseMessage responseMessage) {\n        FinancingApplyResultQueryDTO result = (FinancingApplyResultQueryDTO) responseMessage.getData();\n        String returnStatus = result.getOperationStatus();\n        \n        if (StringUtils.isEmpty(returnStatus)) {\n            log.info(\"单据：{},查询银行状态异常，状态为\", apply.getApplyNumber());\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        String pmcStatus = cmbStatusMapping.getOrDefault(returnStatus, returnStatus);\n        updateApplyStatusIfChanged(apply, pmcStatus);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 更新申请状态（如果状态有变化）\n     * @param apply 融资申请对象\n     * @param newStatus 新状态\n     */\n    private void updateApplyStatusIfChanged(PmcFinanceSupplierApply apply, String newStatus) {\n        if (!apply.getStatus().equals(newStatus)) {\n            log.info(\"单据：{},由状态：{}变更为：{}\", apply.getApplyNumber(), apply.getStatus(), newStatus);\n            apply.setStatus(newStatus);\n            apply.setLastUpdateDate(DateUtils.getNow());\n            changeApplyStatus(apply);\n        } else {\n            log.info(\"单据：{},无状态变更，当前状态：{}，{}\", apply.getApplyNumber(), apply.getStatus(), newStatus);\n        }\n    }\n```\n\n我将使用工具将修改应用到源文件：\n\n",
